A masked diminutive '''species''' lived in [[the galaxy]].

==Biology and appearance==
The [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] were distinguished by their oddly shaped masks, with the ability to open and close their jaw.<ref name="TFA" />

==In the galaxy==
During the [[Imperial Era]], one such member talked with a masked figure on the [[planet]] [[Ferrix]] as [[Bix Caleen]] walked past them.<ref name="Kassa">{{Andor|Kassa (episode)}}</ref>

During the [[New Republic Era]],<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> a [[Unidentified Kajain'sa'Nikto's ally 1|member]] of the species was [[Death|killed]] by the [[Mandalorian]] [[Din Djarin]] after he attempted to steal his [[Z-6 jetpack|jetpack]] in exchange for [[Din Grogu]].<ref name="Chapter 10">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 10: The Passenger}}</ref> Another member, [[Gapgrin Dozito]], was serving a 25-[[Standard year|year]] sentence on [[Selnesh]] for [[Shipjacker|shipjacking]].<ref name="Chapter 14">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 14: The Tragedy}}</ref>

In [[34 ABY]],<ref name="Timelines" /> [[Scrapjaw Motito]], a [[scavenger]], was seen at [[Niima Outpost]] on the [[planet]] [[Jakku]]. Motito disturbed the fellow scavenger [[Rey Skywalker|Rey]], which made the [[bounty hunter]] [[Hoogenz]] laugh.<ref name="TFA" />

==Behind the scenes==
The species first appeared in the [[2015]] [[sequel trilogy]] film, [[Star Wars: Episode VII The Force Awakens|''Star Wars'': Episode VII ''The Force Awakens'']].<ref name="TFA" />

